// .cursor\rules\database.mdc
---
description: Database architecture, Prisma patterns and multi-tenant rules
globs:
  - "src/db/**/*"
  - "**/*.prisma"
  - "src/features/**/server/repository.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---
# Database Setup

- Every business entity must contain:
  - createdAt
  - updatedAt
- All workspace-scoped business entities must contain workspaceId

- Use soft deletes with deletedAt
- Use Prisma ORM
- Never access Prisma directly from React components
- When changing in-scope Prisma models, also sync Inspektor konta (see `account-inspector-sync.mdc`)
